  "description": "For four years, Karen Prime von Mondreal thought of Erich as nothing but her brilliant disciple. However, all that changed when he turned 19 and suddenly confessed his love! He's persistent, and Karen is starting to waver... The only problem is that she'd been priming Erich to become the next monarch, and she has to leave the kingdom so he can build a solid political standing. Can Karen push Erich away when he's determined to stay by her side? More importantly, does she want to?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
